<script setup>
// 从 App.vue 拆出来的一块界面：状态和函数都在 App 里，按同样的名字 inject 进来，模板原样不动
import { inject } from 'vue'
import { ChevronDown, Download, FolderOpen, History, Layers, Maximize, MessageSquare, Monitor, MoreHorizontal, Palette, PanelsTopLeft, Plus, Ruler, Settings2, SlidersHorizontal, Smartphone, Tablet, Undo2, Upload } from 'lucide-vue-next'
const {
  TOOLS, boardOpen, canvasWidth, choosePage, chooseProject, device, download, fileInput,
  imageInput, leftOpen, loading, locked, moreMenu, openDialog, openLeft, page,
  pageId, previewDoc, project, projects, rightOpen, setTool, showBoard, showPreview,
  toggleRight, tool, undo, undoCount, upload, uploadImage, view
} = inject('studio')
</script>

<template>
<header class="app-header">
  <div class="header-left"><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="原型工坊首页"><span class="brand-symbol"><PanelsTopLeft :size="21" /></span><strong>原型工坊</strong><span class="local-badge">本地</span></a><div class="project-picker"><span class="divider"></span><select aria-label="切换项目" :value="project?.id || ''" :disabled="locked || !projects.length" @change="chooseProject($event.target.value)"><option v-if="!projects.length" value="">我的工作区</option><option v-for="p in projects" :key="p.id" :value="p.id">{{ p.name }}</option></select><ChevronDown :size="14" /><label v-if="project?.pages.length > 1" class="file-picker" title="这个项目里有多个 HTML 文件，切换要看的那个"><span>/</span><select aria-label="切换原型文件" :value="pageId" :disabled="locked" @change="choosePage($event.target.value)"><option v-for="p in project.pages" :key="p.id" :value="p.id">{{ p.title }} · v{{ p.version }}</option></select><ChevronDown :size="13" /></label></div><button v-if="!leftOpen" class="icon-button" title="打开对话" aria-label="打开对话" @click="openLeft"><MessageSquare :size="17" /></button></div>
  <div class="header-center"><div class="view-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="查看方式"><button :class="{ active: view === 'preview' && !boardOpen }" @click="showPreview"><Monitor :size="14" /><span>预览</span></button><button :class="{ active: view === 'preview' && boardOpen }" :disabled="!page || !previewDoc" title="展开这一页的所有弹窗 · E" @click="showBoard"><Layers :size="14" /><span>展开</span><kbd>E</kbd></button></div><div v-if="page && view !== 'code'" class="mode-tools" role="group" aria-label="操作方式"><button v-for="t in TOOLS" :key="t.id" :class="{ active: tool === t.id }" :disabled="loading" :title="`${t.label} · ${t.key}：${t.tip}`" @click="setTool(t.id)"><component :is="t.icon" :size="15" /><span>{{ t.label }}</span><kbd>{{ t.key }}</kbd></button></div></div>
  <nav class="header-right" aria-label="画布和项目操作"><div class="device-tools" v-if="view === 'preview' && !boardOpen"><button v-for="d in [{ id: 'desktop', label: '桌面', icon: Monitor }, { id: 'tablet', label: '平板', icon: Tablet }, { id: 'mobile', label: '手机', icon: Smartphone }]" :key="d.id" class="icon-button" :class="{ active: device === d.id }" :aria-label="d.label + '预览'" :title="d.label" @click="device = d.id"><component :is="d.icon" :size="16" /></button><span class="actual-width">{{ canvasWidth }} px</span><button class="icon-button" :disabled="loading || !previewDoc" aria-label="全屏演示" title="全屏演示 · P：收起所有面板，只看原型（给评审、给客户看），Esc 退出" @click="setTool('present')"><Maximize :size="16" /></button></div><div class="history-tools"><button class="icon-button" aria-label="撤销上一步" :title="undoCount ? '撤销上一步 · ⌘/Ctrl + Z' : '暂无可撤销的修改'" :disabled="!undoCount || locked" @click="undo()"><Undo2 :size="16" /></button><button class="history-button" :disabled="!page || loading" title="历史版本" @click="openDialog('history')"><History :size="15" /><span>{{ page ? 'v' + page.version : '历史' }}</span></button></div><button class="export-button" :disabled="!page || locked" title="导出 HTML" @click="download()"><Download :size="15" /><span>导出</span></button><details ref="moreMenu" class="more-menu"><summary class="icon-button" aria-label="更多" title="新建、导入、文件管理、配色、设计规范、模型设置"><MoreHorizontal :size="18" /></summary><div class="more-list" @click="moreMenu?.removeAttribute('open')"><button :disabled="locked" @click="openDialog('new')"><Plus :size="15" />新建</button><button :disabled="locked" @click="fileInput.click()"><Upload :size="15" />导入</button><button :disabled="locked" @click="openDialog('files')"><FolderOpen :size="15" />文件管理</button><hr><button :disabled="!page || loading" @click="openDialog('palette')"><Palette :size="15" />项目配色</button><button @click="openDialog('spec')"><Ruler :size="15" />设计规范</button><button v-if="project?.pages.length > 1" @click="download(true)"><Download :size="15" />导出整个项目 ZIP</button><button @click="openDialog('settings')"><Settings2 :size="15" />模型设置</button></div></details><span class="divider"></span><button class="icon-button" :class="{ active: rightOpen }" aria-label="切换属性面板" @click="toggleRight"><SlidersHorizontal :size="17" /></button></nav>
  <input ref="fileInput" type="file" class="sr-only" accept=".html,.htm,.zip" @change="upload" />
  <input ref="imageInput" type="file" class="sr-only" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp" @change="uploadImage" />
</header>
</template>
